{"stormtroopers(ger2)" "A squad of 12 elite jaegers, skill 8. The main purpose of the German Jaeger Divisions was to fight in adverse terrain where smaller, coordinated units were more facilely combat capable than the brute force offered by the standard infantry divisions. The Jaegers (means hunters in German) relied on a high degree of training, and slightly superior communications. They were among the prioritized to get new weapons such as the StG44 and G43. This elite jaeger squad includes an MG42 team, a sniper, and a rifle-grenadier, allowing for wide scale operation adaptability."}
; [new] card "elites_para(ger2)" cost 374 lvl 1 | soldiers ost_fallschirm_sl, ost_fallschirm_sl_asst_fg_44, ost_fallschirm_sniper, ost_fallschirm_grenadier x2, ost_fallschirm_pzfst_fg, ost_fallschirm_mg x2, ost_fallschirm_mg_asst x2 | tags infantry all inf_only 44 45 | units/ger2/squads.set:19
{"elites_para(ger2)" "A squad of 12 apex paratroopers, skill 10. Battle-scarred Fallschirmjaegers who had undergone many battles and survived since the Battle of Crete, they were among the best men the Fatherland can offer. Includes a sniper, two MG42 teams, 2 FG42s, and 3 rifle-grenadiers."}
